<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101962" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχολικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχολή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			) <i>scholastic</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπομνήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					3.83b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παράδοσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heliod.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				49.8.1
			</span></i>; <i>academic</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. συγγυμνασία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Conj.</u>
					213.2
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. πλάσματα</span>
			<i>school</i> compositions, <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				18.18
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἀγνόημα</span> an error
				<i>of the</i> (<span class="entity">Aristarchean</span>)
			<i>school</i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.111
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχολικὸν μᾶλλον ἢ
				παραγγελματικόν</span>, more <i>like lectures</i> than a
			handbook, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				22
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>
			<i>after the manner of the schools</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				8.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>long-winded, tedious</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				3.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				10.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>scholarly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VS</u>
				2.9.2
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχολικά, τά</span>, =
			<i>causae summatim excerptae,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
